the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    *a thing* is the gp of *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is the anc of *a second thing*.
    *a thing* is a person.
    *a thing* is isparent.
    *a thing* is childless.
    *a thing* is the parent of *a second thing*.

the knowledge base kinship includes:

the text of the ruleset is at "sources/kinship.rules".

a thing is the gp of a second thing if
    the thing is the parent of a third thing
    and the third thing is the parent of the second thing.

a thing is the anc of a second thing if
    the thing is the parent of the second thing.

a thing is the anc of a second thing if
    the thing is the parent of a third thing
    and the third thing is the anc of the second thing.

a thing is a person if
    the thing is the parent of a second thing.

a thing is a person if
    a second thing is the parent of the thing.

a thing is isparent if
    the thing is the parent of a second thing.

a thing is childless if
    the thing is a person
    and it is not the case that the thing is isparent.

scenario dataset is, as stated in the dataset:
    art is the parent of bob.
    art is the parent of bea.
    bob is the parent of cal.
    bob is the parent of cam.
    bea is the parent of cat.
    bea is the parent of coe.
    anc expects answers ["art is the anc of bea", "art is the anc of bob", "art is the anc of cal", "art is the anc of cam", "art is the anc of cat", "art is the anc of coe", "bea is the anc of cat", "bea is the anc of coe", "bob is the anc of cal", "bob is the anc of cam"].
    childless expects answers ["cal is childless", "cam is childless", "cat is childless", "coe is childless"].
    gp expects answers ["art is the gp of cal", "art is the gp of cam", "art is the gp of cat", "art is the gp of coe"].
    isparent expects answers ["art is isparent", "bea is isparent", "bob is isparent"].
    person expects answers ["art is a person", "bea is a person", "bob is a person", "cal is a person", "cam is a person", "cat is a person", "coe is a person"].

query anc is:
    which thing is the anc of which second thing.

query childless is:
    which thing is childless.

query gp is:
    which thing is the gp of which second thing.

query isparent is:
    which thing is isparent.

query person is:
    which thing is a person.

